  description: You emerge from the passage onto a bleak, windswept height. Before you stands a ruined chapel of black stone, its broken gables rising into the low cloud. Fragments of fallen masonry lie scattered along the path, and beneath a pointed arch, the chapel doorway yawns open in shadow.<br>
