  locationImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44f629f91a2ee50878f4bae7b38ab797, type: 3}
  description: You stand inside the ruined fishing hut. Broken roof boards cover the floor, and rain has blackened the walls. A narrow shelf holds a cracked cup and a tangle of fishing line. Against the wall stands a rusted iron stove, cold and streaked with soot. The little room feels as though it has been waiting for its fisherman to return.<br>
  connections:
  - {fileID: 1878236870}
  items:
