  interactions:
  - action: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 658405d1e7ff410749efa0f6d153ab58, type: 2}
    response: You lean over the well. The darkness below seems to rise to meet you. Two eyes snap open, followed by rows of hooked teeth. You throw yourself backward as a great serpent erupts from the shaft and coils around the well, cutting off every escape. It rears above you, jaws spreading. The staff in your hand begins to hum. You have only a moment to act.
