--- !u!114 &818700091
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 818700089}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The crack of splintering wood tears you from darkness. For an instant, you remember fire, a scream, and black water rising over broken planks. Then cold earth presses against your face, and you draw a ragged breath that tastes of smoke and dirt.


    Your body answers slowly. Pain creeps through your limbs as you push yourself onto your knees. Moss clings to your skin. Dry roots coil around your arms, sticky with black sap, and you tear yourself free.


    You wipe the dirt from your eyes and use a fallen branch to pull yourself upright. There is no wreck in sight. Only black rock, wet moss, and a wall of white fog waiting ahead.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
