  locationImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3181efbcfac93c59d98b0b0fac61121b, type: 3}
  description: "The Ferryman\u2019s fingers close around the coins. He steps aside, and you climb into the boat. Without a word, he casts off. You look back once at the ruined chapel and the ghost land surrounding it, then turn toward the wall of fog ahead. The shoreline disappears behind you as the boat drifts silently into the unknown."
  connections: []
  items: []
