  - action: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cd9d033919522022dbbc95f582e4d4f8, type: 2}
    response: "You place the strange amulet in the crone\u2019s waiting hand. She closes her fingers around it and gives you a heavy brass key. \u201CThe gate will open for you now. Take the path beyond it and leave this island. Do not come back.\u201D"
