  - action: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 658405d1e7ff410749efa0f6d153ab58, type: 2}
    response: Beneath the hood, you can make out no face, only a deeper darkness. His hands are pale and long-fingered, and black water clings to the hem of his robe. Though the boat shifts gently beneath him, the Ferryman himself remains perfectly still.
    interactionImage: {fileID: 0}
